#Data table for symmetric interior loops of size 2
#The Enthalpies at 37 degrees for RNA
 
#Data Arrangement:
#For the 4x4 tables, each starting pair needs its own table.
#This is the AA table:  
#			5' --> 3'   
#			    X 
#			   A A          
#			   U U
#			    Y
#			3' <-- 5'   
#			    Y->          
#	   	---------------------------- 
#	(X) 	A	C	G	U  
#	 | 	----------------------------
#	 V   
#	(A) 	-0.5	-0.5	-0.5	-0.5
#	(C) 	-0.5	-0.5	-0.5	-0.5
#	(G) 	-0.5	-0.5	-8.3	-0.5
#	(U) 	-0.5	-0.5	-0.5	-3.9

#An energy of "." is "infinity," i.e. not allowed.

